    "1aa59ad489db5e8c9de8b023": {
      "project": "transparenta-eu",
      "source": "https://transparenta.eu/llms.txt",
      "observed_at": "2026-10-29T22:41:57.720635+00:00",
      "recipe": "data/taxonomy-v2/structura/recipes/transparenta-eu.json",
      "alias": "transparenta-eu-llms",
      "artifact": "docs/reports/site-structure-pilot/evidence/transparenta-eu-llms.txt",
      "sha256": "eba5f749625f2f1feda9272e7d94d331706c0efc9e967bff73da4a0fee28927a",
      "locator": {
        "type": "text",
        "start": 0,
        "end": 3218,
        "excerpt": "# Transparenta.eu — AI Usage Guide\n\nBase URL:\n- https://transparenta.eu\n\n## Documentation\n- Parameters index (JSON): https://transparenta.eu/ai/index.json\n- URL/API guide (Markdown): https://transparenta.eu/api-guide.md\n- Sitemap: https://transparenta.eu/sitemap.xml\n\n## Routes Overview\n- /entities/{cui}: Single entity details and analytics\n- /entity-analytics: Cross-entity analytics (table, treemap, line-items)\n- /budget-explorer: Budget exploration by categories (functional/economic)\n- /pnrr: PNRR project dashboard by component, geography, beneficiary, progress, and risk signals\n\n## Entities Page (/entities/{cui})\nHow to query:\n1) Put the entity CUI in the path: /entities/4267117\n2) Add filters as query params. Common examples:\n   - ?year=2025\n   - ?period=YEAR | QUARTER | MONTH\n   - ?view=overview | map | income-trends | expense-trends\n   - ?normalization=total | total_euro | per_capita | per_capita_euro\n\nParameters (full docs):\n- https://transparenta.eu/ai/entities-parameters.json\n\nExamples:\n- https://transparenta.eu/entities/4267117?view=overview&year=2024\n- https://transparenta.eu/entities/4267117?year=2025&view=map&normalization=per_capita\n- https://transparenta.eu/entities/4267117?period=QUARTER&quarter=Q4\n\n## Entity Analytics (/entity-analytics)\nPurpose: Compare entities with filters and switch views (table/line-items/treemap)\nCommon params:\n- filter.report_period.type=YEAR|QUARTER|MONTH\n- filter.account_category=ch|vn\n- filter.normalization=total|per_capita|total_euro|per_capita_euro\n- view=table|line-items\n- treemapPrimary=fn|ec, treemapDepth=chapter|subchapter|paragraph\n\nParameters JSON: (coming from schema)\n- https://transparenta.eu/ai/entities-analytics-parameters.json\n\nExample:\n- https://transparenta.eu/entity-analytics?view=line-items\n\n## Budget Explorer (/budget-explorer)\nPurpose: Explore budget composition across categories and years\nCommon params:\n- view=overview|treemap|sankey|list\n- primary=fn|ec, depth=main|detail\n- filter.{report_period, account_category, normalization, report_type}\n\nParameters JSON:\n- https://transparenta.eu/ai/budget-explorer-parameters.json\n\nExamples:\n- https://transparenta.eu/budget-explorer?view=treemap&primary=fn\n- https://transparenta.eu/budget-explorer?view=list&filter.account_category=vn\n\n## PNRR (/pnrr)\nPurpose: Explore National Recovery and Resilience Plan projects, funding, progress, beneficiaries, geography, and risk signals.\nCommon params:\n- view=overview|projects|beneficiaries|map|anomalies\n- components, counties, fundingSources, measures, cris\n- progressCategories=completed|advanced|mid|under30|not-started|unknown\n- onlyAnomalies=true, excludeMicro=true, includeNational=false\n- search, beneficiarySearch, beneficiaryCui, uatSiruta, uatSirutas\n\nParameters JSON:\n- https://transparenta.eu/ai/pnrr-parameters.json\n\nExamples:\n- https://transparenta.eu/pnrr\n- https://transparenta.eu/pnrr?onlyAnomalies=true&view=anomalies\n- https://transparenta.eu/pnrr?view=map&granularity=county\n\nNotes:\n- Year range supported: dynamic; see parameter JSON files for min/max.\n- All parameters are optional unless stated; defaults are inferred from the UI.\n - For API integration, prefer `/ai/*.json` schemas and `api-guide.md` patterns."
      }
